 motor-only dry-run cycle Step1..Step10 behind MachineType.h #define
 W906_HT9050_DRYRUN (50% speed, C_OutArmSmallY waits 3 s instead of its
 sensor, Step7 Out Shuttle 1 then 2, Out Shuttle 2 back left after Step10,
 Index Z stays: homed and encoder within +-20 = at origin); acarry.cpp shuttle
 protection + dry-run Index Z origin; csystem.cpp DoAllProcess hooks the dry
 run; cinitial.cpp the three shuttle / Auto pair checks skipped during the dry
 run only; uHeaterThread.cpp no WAR15182 during the dry run; WebBridgeTags.cpp
 + web ht9045_sitepanel_size.js main page Test Site follows Setup's site
 count; 10-04 HT9050-TYPE (EastSun 1004: 9050GPIB decodes to Type_HT9050;
 W906_HT9050_AS_LS goes back), SHTCENTER, RULE10 C_OutArmSmallY, Teach KB;
 MachineType.h also records the machine's real-hardware setting (SOFT_SIMULTE
 commented, as the machine has always built). Tests HT9050_DryRun /
 HT9050_ShtSafe / TeachKb / MachineCylinders_HT9050 / homeclass / HomeMonitor
 / HomeBlock / WebMotorAccess pass; F5 and o2 build.

