+//   若可以請將Out Shuttle1移至右邊，移動前請確認Out Shuttle2是否在Tech.iOutShuttle2Left上，這是Out Shuttle1進出Index區的安全點位，進出接需判斷」
+//  and rule 9 =(A)「程式自動把 Out Shuttle 2 移到 Left」with (B)「...也請等Out Arm ZA確實到達Home點後再移動」.
+//  Why: this machine runs the 9046_LS flow (database.cpp:517), which never moves nor reads MOutShuttle1/2, while In Shuttle 1 Right
+//  (Index side) and Out Shuttle 1 Left (91850, inside the Index area) are the same hand-over point -- Out Shuttle 1 left at Left = crash.
+//  HT9050 only (9050GPIB, the same flag as uhome.cpp W906_IsHT9050: the origin hook answers); other machines: golden, nothing called.
+//  An axis with no motor object or Mot_Table Enable=0 counts as in place / at home (as the full HOME's W906_AxisOff).
+#ifndef W906_HT9050_SHT_POS_TOL
+#define W906_HT9050_SHT_POS_TOL 100     // encoder counts: |ReadEncoderPos - target| <= this = "at the point" (and MotionDone)
+#endif
+static bool W906_ShtIsHT9050()      { return W906_Ht9050OrgHome(MTrayX)!=-2; }
+static bool W906_ShtAxisOff(int mi) { return MOT[mi].Motor==NULL || MOT[mi].Motor->Enable==false; }
+static bool W906_ShtMoving(int mi)  { return !W906_ShtAxisOff(mi) && MOT[mi].Motor->MotionDone()==false; }
+static void W906_ShtStopIfMoving(int mi) { if(W906_ShtMoving(mi)) MOT[mi].PCIL132_StopMotor(); }
+static bool W906_ShtAt(int mi, int target)
+{
+    if(W906_ShtAxisOff(mi)) return true;
+    if(MOT[mi].Motor->MotionDone()==false) return false;
+    return abs(MOT[mi].ReadEncoderPos()-target)<=W906_HT9050_SHT_POS_TOL;
+}
+static bool W906_ShtOutArmZAHome()                                              // the Out Arm ZA's HOME lamp (HT9050 ORG rule, Motor/mymotor.cpp ScanMotorStatus)
+{
+    if(W906_ShtAxisOff(MOutArmZA)) return true;
+    MOT[MOutArmZA].ScanMotorStatus();
+    return MOT[MOutArmZA].Led[iHomeLed];
+}
+bool W906_Ht9050IndexZ1AtHome();                                                 //AI(W906-HT9050-Z1HOMEPOS) 20261005: defined right below
+bool W906_Ht9050DryRunOn();                                                      //AI(W906-HT9050-Z1HOMEPOS) 20261005: Ht9050DryRun.h
+static bool W906_ShtIndexZ1Safe()                                               // as IsTestZ1NotSafeShuttle1CanNotMove: Z1 above its check height and its HOME lamp on
+{
+    if(W906_ShtAxisOff(MTestZ1)) return true;
+    //AI(W906-HT9050-INDEX1203) 20261005: EastSun 1005「Index的部分是用一般馬達不是用Gali的模式，後續需要修正成1203的Motor Move」-- the encoder is read as
+    //  a plain 1203 axis (MOT[].ReadEncoderPos), not through Gali_ReadEncoderBelowCheckHeight; same rule: below Prod.TestZ1_Safe - 3000 (golden's
+    //  GaliPosOffSet margin, myGALILmotor.cpp Gali_ReadEncoderBelowCheckHeight) = not safe. Moving the Index Z itself by 1203 MotorMove
+    //  (and point-to-point after Contact / Auto Height) is a later item (WORKLOG).
+    if(W906_Ht9050DryRunOn()) return W906_Ht9050IndexZ1AtHome();   //AI(W906-HT9050-Z1HOMEPOS) 20261005: dry run only -- the encoder rule below
+    if(MOT[MTestZ1].ReadEncoderPos() < Prod.TestZ1_Safe-3000) return false;
+    #ifndef SOFT_SIMULTE
+    MOT[MTestZ1].ScanMotorStatus();
+    if(MOT[MTestZ1].Led[iHomeLed]==false) return false;
+    #endif
+    return true;
+}
+//AI(W906-HT9050-Z1HOMEPOS) 20261005: the Index Z1 "at home" in the HT9050 DRY RUN only (Ht9050DryRun.cpp; W906_ShtIndexZ1Safe above in the
+//  dry run). EastSun 1005「Index Z的部分就不要動做，目前將Index 動作By Pass掉，要保證Index Z在Home點，Index Z回完Home以後再判斷Z軸Encorder是否在
+//  正負20內，若在此區間內則都當作Index Z在Home點，此闡述出來的模式在於現在模擬空跑的模式下才能進行」: homed (HomeFlag 1), not moving and the
+//  encoder within +-W906_HT9050_DRYRUN_Z1_HOME_TOL of 0 (the HT9050 home position, myGALILmotor.cpp AI(W906-HT9050-HOMEPOS0)); the HOME lamp
+//  is not asked (1005 01:38:57 oplog: Z1's 2nd home in the full HOME ended READY at enc 0 with the lamp off -- the DS402 home ends just off
