+    return true;
+}
+//AI(W906-HT9050-SHTSAFE-2) 20261004: the same rules for the Type_HT9050 flow (EastSun 1004「先幫我切成Type_HT9050」, and the shuttle
+//  protection must come with it): Do_Auto_InSH / Do_Auto_OutSH (910 translation, below) replace Do_Auto_SHT1 there, and 910's only
+//  interlock is InSH case 200's `if(OutSHT1InLF()) break;` (Out Shuttle 1 parked exactly at Left; moving or in between passes).
